# ============================================================
# SECRETS (R108-9 — defense in depth, 2026-07-27)
# .env enthaelt API keys + GitHub PAT. NIEMALS tracken.
# ============================================================
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
mas-engineer/.env
mas-engineer/.env.*
!mas-engineer/.env.example

# .keys — API-Key-Datei (DeepSeek etc.). NIEMALS tracken.
.keys
mas-engineer/.keys

# Vendor / external install-scripts (downloaded on-demand, not source)
# R110-102 (2026-08-04): goose-install.sh is the upstream Goose installer
# from https://github.com/block/goose — generic 14.7KB bootstrap, not a
# mas-engineer asset. Re-download via the curl command at the top of the
# file if needed. Tracked version would just rot.
goose-install.sh
mas-engineer/goose-install.sh

# ============================================================
# RUNTIME (regenerated, soll NICHT tracked)
# ============================================================

# Root-level .mase/ (R110-165 phase 1.1: legacy test writes + message-queue
# runtime — symmetric to mas-engineer/.mase/mq/ already ignored). Without
# this, root .mase/mq/test.ndjson etc. surface as untracked at the repo root.
.mase/

# Root-level e2e-results/ (R110-165 phase 1.1: runtime test output. Real
# evidence goes to logs/e2e-results/ which is intentionally committed per
# R110-143. The root e2e-results/ is just runtime noise.)
e2e-results/

# .mase/ runtime (NICHT: knowledge, rules, templates, SOT)
.mase/todo.md
.mase/changes.json
.mase/changes.unlimited-archive-*.json
.mase/health-history.json
.mase/health-report.json
.mase/audit.log.jsonl
.mase/audit_result.yaml
.mase/analysis.json
.mase/guardian.yaml
.mase/.last_confirmation
.mase/backups/
.mase/checkpoints/
.mase/workflow_runs/
.mase/dashboards/

# e2e-results/ runtime (R110-22 — raw-results.json ist mas-engineer
# workflow-run output, regeneriert sich bei jedem run, NICHT evidence)
# Echte e2e-evidence (z.B. EVIDENCE-*.md, EVIDENCE-*.json) wird explizit committed.
e2e-results/*/raw-results.json
# Auch unter logs/ — R110-151: top-level rule matched keine sub-pfade
# (warum die 2026-08-14 run-1..4 raw-results als untracked erschienen)
logs/e2e-results/*/raw-results.json

# ============================================================
# logs/ — SINGLE central destination for ALL mas-generated logs,
# evidence, test results and AI-generated reports (from mas-engineer
# or any other AI).
#
# The e2e logs/evidence under logs/e2e-results/, logs/e2e-evidence/ and
# logs/e2e-evidence-gen2/ are the PUBLIC PROOF that mas-engineer works.
# They ARE committed to GitHub (R110-143, 2026-08-07) so anyone can verify
# the claimed test results. They are scanned for secrets before commit
# (test_r110134_8_evidence_secret_leak) and must contain no API keys.
#
# Only NON-EVIDENCE artifacts stay ignored: build output (dist/), AI
# research outputs, and loose reports/scripts at the logs/ top level.
# ============================================================
logs/dist/
logs/outputs/
logs/seo-research-output/
logs/run_security_scanner.py
logs/run_static_analyzer.py
logs/recipe_live_test.yaml
logs/recipe_live_test_FINAL.yaml
logs/*.json
logs/*.py
logs/ai_agent_saas_marketing_report.md

